  "title": "The Bird on the Porch",
  "source": "original",
  "text": "A small bird landed on our porch this morning. It had brown feathers and a short beak. My sister was scared it would peck at the door, but the bird just chirped and turned its head. Then a car started nearby, and the bird darted off toward the garden. We watched it perch on a tall fir tree.",
